[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "んー！\u3000おいしい！\nやっぱり、フロッケのご飯は最高ね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mmm! Delicious! Flocke, your cooking really is the best!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えへへ、ありがとうございます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ehehe, thank you so much."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しかし、船の上でこんな豪華な食事が食えるとはな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Never thought we'd be having such fancy meals at sea."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術士の方々が作ってくれた蔵のおかげで、\n色々な食材が使えますから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's all thanks to the storage system the alchemists made. We can keep all sorts of ingredients fresh!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "不思議なもんだよな。\n何日も食料を保存しておける蔵なんて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pretty amazing stuff. A storage that keeps food fresh for days..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "乾パンとか干し肉とか、保存食ばっかりじゃ\n飽きちゃうからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, you'd get tired of nothing but hardtack and dried meat, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "色々な栄養が摂取できるってのも、航海じゃでかいぜ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Getting proper nutrition makes a huge difference on long voyages."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えへへ、苦労して作った甲斐がありました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Glad all our hard work paid off!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おかわりもありますから、欲しい方は言ってくださいね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's plenty more if anyone wants seconds!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃ、おかわり！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then I'll have more!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "って、さっそく！？\nヴァレリア、食べるの早すぎない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Already!? Valeria, don't you think you're eating a bit fast?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんか、手が止まらないのよ。ご飯が美味しいのは\nもちろんだけど、この雰囲気がいいっていうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I just can't stop eating. The food's amazing, of course, but there's just something about this atmosphere..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ、その気持ち分かるかも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, I know what you mean."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんなに素敵な月の下で食事なんて、\nなんだかすごく特別な感じがしますよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Dining under such beautiful moons... it feels like a really special moment, doesn't it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "昼の間はひどい嵐だったのに。すっかり晴れましたね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hard to believe we had such a terrible storm earlier. Now it's completely clear."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大の月と、子の月……。月が２つあるのも、\nこの世界の特徴ですね。すこぶる興味深いです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The greater moon and the lesser moon... Having two moons is quite characteristic of this world. Most fascinating."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしたちの世界じゃ月は１つだもんね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Our world only has one moon, after all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "子の月には黄金星って別名もあってな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The lesser moon's got another name too—the Golden Star."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へえ、黄金星……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? The Golden Star..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "船乗りの間じゃ、あの星に航海の無事を願う……\nなんつう風習もあったりするくらいだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Among sailors, there's even a tradition of praying to that star for safe voyage."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ある意味、この世界の信仰の象徴なのですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So in a way, it's a symbol of faith in this world."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ……あの星は金の塊なんだって、\nバカなことを言ってた奴もいたがな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... there were some idiots who used to say that star was made of solid gold."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "黄金星は、金の塊でできてんだ！\nそれだけの宝があれば一生分の酒が買えるぜ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Golden Star's made of pure gold! With that much treasure, we could buy booze for life!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船員Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Crew Member A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははは！\u3000そりゃいいな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hahaha! Now that's the life!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船員Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Crew Member B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まったく……信仰心のない奴らだねえ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honestly... such faithless fools."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "バーバラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Barbara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいじゃねえか、黄金星。俺らの船で、\nいつか星の海にも漕ぎ出してやろうぜ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Golden Star, eh? One day we'll sail our ship right up into that starry sea!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "バーバラ、俺はな。\nあの黄金星を持って帰ってくる男だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Barbara, just you watch. I'm gonna be the man who brings back that Golden Star!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よく言った船長！\u3000それでこそ男だ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well said, Captain! Now that's a real man's promise!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船員Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Crew Member A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "持って帰るぞ！\u3000黄金星！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're bringing it back! The Golden Star!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおーー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "YEAHHH!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船員たち",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Crew"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当に仕方ない男だね。\nあんたって奴はさ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You really are something else. You know that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "バーバラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Barbara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ふっ、懐かしいな。\nあの頃は、そんなバカみてえな話をよくした",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Heh, those were the days. We used to talk such nonsense back then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――船長……俺たち、アンタについていくぜ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—Captain... we'll follow you anywhere!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……っ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランツェさん、どうかしたんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze, is everything alright?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、いや……なんでもねえ。\n気のせいか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, no... it's nothing. Must be hearing things..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえ、クラウディア。\nこの月に合いそうな曲、何か演奏してよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey Klaudia, how about playing something that suits these moons?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいですね！\u3000フロッケも聞きたいです！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh yes! I'd love to hear that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃあ……この曲はどうかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well then... how about this piece?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]